  "schema:description": "Consolidated data for Belgian credit institutions from 2014 to 2017, based on the IFRS “European FINREP” standards. It includes data on assets, liabilities, loan portfolios, derivatives, income statements, and regulatory capital ratios, highlighting financial health and asset quality in Belgium’s banking sector.",
